etrade-cli is an independent Go implementation of a client for the
E*TRADE Developer Platform REST API v1:

    E*TRADE Developer Platform — https://developer.etrade.com
    pyetrade (endpoint surface reference) — https://github.com/jessecooper/pyetrade
    Copyright (c) Jesse Cooper and the pyetrade contributors
    Licensed under the MIT License

The endpoint paths, parameter names, and OAuth 1.0a flow implemented here
follow the official E*TRADE API documentation and were cross-checked
against pyetrade. The Go implementation in this repository is an
independent re-implementation written for this project; it is not
affiliated with or endorsed by E*TRADE (Morgan Stanley), the pyetrade
project, or Charles Schwab & Co., Inc.
